  "post_content": "<p>El Museu del Taulell &quot;Manolo Safont&quot; de Onda acoge hoy la &uacute;ltima jornada del curso Intensive Thematic School: Ceramic Materials, promovido por la Red Europea de Excelencia Qu&iacute;mica.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_1819.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Esta ma&ntilde;ana, las personas participantes han conocido las piezas del Museu del Taulell, en una visita guiada a cargo de su director, Vicent Estall, &nbsp;y han recibido clases de dise&ntilde;o y patrimonio por parte de expertos de diferentes nacionalidades, entre ellos Jorge Bakali, que cesar&aacute;&nbsp;en octubre como presidente de la Sociedad Espa&ntilde;ola de Cer&aacute;mica y Vidrio (SECyV).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1812.jpg\" alt=\"img_1812\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1813.jpg\" alt=\"img_1813\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1814.jpg\" alt=\"img_1814\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1816.jpg\" alt=\"img_1816\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1817.jpg\" alt=\"img_1817\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1818.jpg\" alt=\"img_1818\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1819.jpg\" alt=\"img_1819\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1820.jpg\" alt=\"img_1820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1821.jpg\" alt=\"img_1821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1822.jpg\" alt=\"img_1822\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1823.jpg\" alt=\"img_1823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1835.jpg\" alt=\"img_1835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1836.jpg\" alt=\"img_1836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1837.jpg\" alt=\"img_1837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1838.jpg\" alt=\"img_1838\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1839.jpg\" alt=\"img_1839\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1840.jpg\" alt=\"img_1840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1841.jpg\" alt=\"img_1841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1843.jpg\" alt=\"img_1843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1844.jpg\" alt=\"img_1844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/intensiveschool/img_1845.jpg\" alt=\"img_1